{"body":"## Summary\r\n\r\n- Present each changed file as an inset, rounded card in the Agents Changes view.\r\n- Show secondary file actions on hover or focus and align the collapse control with toolbar actions.\r\n- Highlight only the focused card with subtle, theme-aware active and keyboard-focus states.\r\n- Expand collapsed cards before running full-file expand or collapse actions.\r\n- Add bottom scroll clearance so the final card is not obscured by the horizontal scrollbar.\r\n\r\nBefore:\r\n<img width=\"1526\" height=\"896\" alt=\"CleanShot 2026-07-24 at 21 19 56@2x\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fd3d38e9-f719-4762-a635-040fb9570f3e\" />\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1526\" height=\"1654\" alt=\"CleanShot 2026-07-24 at 21 20 12@2x\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8a7c5f7f-bc6a-4a4f-90e5-cfe0e7023530\" />\r\n\r\nAfter:\r\n<img width=\"1806\" height=\"528\" alt=\"CleanShot 2026-07-24 at 21 21 27@2x\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fef797e9-da7b-4746-86b9-5923997155fd\" />\r\n<img width=\"1806\" height=\"1450\" alt=\"CleanShot 2026-07-24 at 21 24 53@2x\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/01bff68e-fd6c-4aa6-ac22-93426067c23b\" />\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/678fba3b-3cfc-42d9-af47-fcde0b8032fd\r\n\r\n\r\n## Validation\r\n\r\n- Core transpilation and extension build pass.\r\n- Changes action tests pass (7 tests).\r\n- Precommit hygiene and diff checks pass.\r\n- Full typecheck remains blocked by unrelated existing Copilot SDK and Agent Host errors.\r\n","bodyHtml":"<h2 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h2>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Present each changed file as an inset, rounded card in the Agents Changes view.</li>\n<li>Show secondary file actions on hover or focus and align the collapse control with toolbar actions.</li>\n<li>Highlight only the focused card with subtle, theme-aware active and keyboard-focus states.</li>\n<li>Expand collapsed cards before running full-file expand or collapse actions.</li>\n<li>Add bottom scroll clearance so the final card is not obscured by the horizontal scrollbar.</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Before:<br>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/48927690/626619849-fd3d38e9-f719-4762-a635-040fb9570f3e.png?jwt=redacted-jwt-1\"><img width=\"1526\" height=\"896\" alt=\"CleanShot 2026-07-24 at 21 19 56@2x\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/48927690/626619849-fd3d38e9-f719-4762-a635-040fb9570f3e.png?jwt=redacted-jwt-1\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 896px;; aspect-ratio: 1526 / 896; background-color: var(--bgColor-muted); border-radius: 6px\" class=\"js-gh-image-fallback\"></a></p>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/48927690/626619899-8a7c5f7f-bc6a-4a4f-90e5-cfe0e7023530.png?jwt=redacted-jwt-2\"><img width=\"1526\" height=\"1654\" alt=\"CleanShot 2026-07-24 at 21 20 12@2x\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/48927690/626619899-8a7c5f7f-bc6a-4a4f-90e5-cfe0e7023530.png?jwt=redacted-jwt-2\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 1654px;; aspect-ratio: 1526 / 1654; background-color: var(--bgColor-muted); border-radius: 6px\" class=\"js-gh-image-fallback\"></a>\n<p dir=\"auto\">After:<br>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/48927690/626619920-fef797e9-da7b-4746-86b9-5923997155fd.png?jwt=redacted-jwt-3\"><img width=\"1806\" height=\"528\" alt=\"CleanShot 2026-07-24 at 21 21 27@2x\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/48927690/626619920-fef797e9-da7b-4746-86b9-5923997155fd.png?jwt=redacted-jwt-3\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 528px;; aspect-ratio: 1806 / 528; background-color: var(--bgColor-muted); border-radius: 6px\" class=\"js-gh-image-fallback\"></a><br>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" h