cks pass.</li>\n<li>Full typecheck remains blocked by unrelated existing Copilot SDK and Agent Host errors.</li>\n</ul>","bodyVersion":"cdf7b24b8352f283f2fb2bef7df5b3edec96692e4d31a99cd07ec51caa12f9bd"}